  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **(Second number × 2) = (First number + Third number) + 10**\n\n**(59, 83, 97)**\n\n→ (83 × 2) = (59 + 97) + 10\n\n→ 166 = 156 + 10\n\n**(63, 87, 101)**\n\n→ (87 × 2) = (63 + 101) + 10\n\n→ 174 = 164 + 10\n\nNow, let's check each option as per the logic,\n\n1) **(67, 91, 115)**\n\n→ (91 × 2) = (67 + 115) + 10\n\n→ 182 ≠ 182 + 10 \n\n2) **(71, 95, 109)**\n\n→ (95 × 2) = (71 + 109) + 10\n\n→ 190 = 180 + 10 ⇒ **Satisfies the logic.**\n\n3) **(51, 65, 89)**\n\n→ (65 × 2) = (51 + 89) + 10\n\n→ 130 ≠ 140 + 10\n\n4) **(48, 82, 96)**\n\n→ (82 × 2) = (48 + 96) + 10\n\n→ 164 ≠ 144 + 10\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"(71, 95, 109)\".**",
